    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_a0xfrABBDQRlDoMAFxiwYs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkRFFtRldjRTExVTBGcWIxTnVZWEJvVm1oWVFrRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "想喺尖沙咀附近搵一間坐得舒服、環境靚又夠安靜，同朋友慢慢食飯傾偈，Mue Mue 絕對唔會令你失望。\n\n餐廳裝潢時尚雅致，環境舒適，無論聚餐定約會都好適合。菜式擺盤精緻，味道不錯，雖然未至於驚艷，但整體水準穩定。\n\n價錢屬中上，不過考慮到餐廳環境、氣氛同服務，我覺得算合理。每道菜份量都好正常，唔會過少亦唔會過多，啱啱好。\n\n服務方面值得一讚，職員有禮貌又細心，整體用餐體驗十分舒服。想搵一間可以慢慢坐、慢慢傾、享受環境嘅餐廳，Mue Mue 係一個唔錯嘅選擇。\n\nIf you’re looking for a stylish, quiet, and comfortable restaurant near Tsim Sha Tsui to catch up with friends, Mue Mue is a great choice.\n\nThe restaurant has a modern and elegant interior, creating a relaxing atmosphere that’s perfect for a leisurely meal or a get-together. The dishes are beautifully presented and taste good. While the food may not be extraordinary, the overall quality is consistently satisfying.\n\nPrices are in the mid-to-upper range, but they’re reasonable when you consider the lovely ambience, comfortable setting, and attentive service. Portion sizes are also just right.\n\nThe service was excellent, with friendly and attentive staff throughout our visit. Overall, it’s a place I’d happily return to when I want good food in a pleasant environment.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
